<card id="c" title="Gusinje Bus Stop: Where the Bus to Podgorica and Plav Actually Stops">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p><b>Is there a bus from Gusinje to Plav?</b> Yes. All four services call at Plav first, so any of them will get you there. It is the first stop out of Gusinje.</p>
<p><b>Which company runs the bus?</b> Elan Company, to Plav and Podgorica.</p>
<p><b>Can I buy the ticket online?</b> Yes, at busticket4.me. It costs about 15.80 euros and has to be printed before you travel. Otherwise pay the driver in cash on board.</p>
<p><b>Did this save you standing around?</b></p>
<p>If the stop moves or something here is out of date, tell me and I will fix the page. There are no ads on it and no affiliate links — <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/cdroma">coffee</a> is the whole business model. Not your thing? <a href="https://www.instagram.com/romans_daily_diary">Follow the trip on Instagram</a> instead. That helps too.</p>
